      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, those are helpful. i'm wondering though, some people argue that focusing too much on \"structural\" stuff ignores how much individual choices and personal responsibility matter in building wealth. how should i address those viewpoints in the curriculum? should i just frame them as wrong or is there a way to integrate them?",
